  "body": "Experience the perfect balance of coastal tranquility and city convenience at Weiti Bay. Your dream lifestyle awaits!  This home will be designed specially to suit you and your family. \r\n•\t6 bedrooms \r\n•\t4 Bathrooms\r\n•\tOpen plan Kitchen with Dining/Lounge \r\n•\tDouble Garage \r\n•\tDesigner kitchen including scullery with modern Bosch stainless steel appliances. \r\n•\tModern wall hung vanities \r\n•\tQuality tapware & tiles to bathroom \r\n•\tDouble Glazed Joinery & upgrade insulation throughout \r\n•\t10 Year Master Builders Guarantee \r\nLocation:\r\nWeiti Bay, 30km north of Auckland CBD, nestled along the stunning eastern coastline of Auckland’s North Shore.\r\nKey Features: \r\n•\tExclusive Gated Community: Enjoy security, privacy, and a tranquil atmosphere.\r\n•\tBreathtaking Views: Panoramic vistas of the ocean, rolling hills, and native bushland.\r\n•\t Proximity to City & Amenities: Just a 30-minute drive to Auckland CBD and close to beaches, cafes, and top schools.\r\nLifestyle Benefits:\r\n•\tLocated on what was once a serene pine plantation, Weiti Bay offers a peaceful retreat while keeping you connected to city life.\r\n•\tPerfect for nature lovers with walking tracks, pristine coastline, and abundant wildlife.\r\n•\tFamily-friendly environment with recreational spaces and a close-knit community.\r\n Build Your Dream Home:\r\nThis is your opportunity to create a custom-built home that reflects your unique style, surrounded by natural beauty.\r\nThese pictures are an indication of what your dream home could look like. If you’re thinking about building, our Book of Ideas is the best place to start. Packed full of inspirational design ideas and a step-by-step guide of the building process. Get your free copy from navigationhomes.co.nz today. \r\nContact Us Today!\r\nDon't miss out on securing your slice of paradise.\r\nContact Sanketh on 027 7733336 or email sanketh@navigationhomes.co.nz \r\nOr check out or website http://www.navigationhomes.co.nz We look forward to hearing from you! Got your finance YET? See if you qualify here: https://www.newbuild.co.nz/loan-qualifying-calculator",
